<messaging:emailTemplate subject="{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TimeEntry__c.LabelPlural} created for resource {!relatedTo.Resource__r.Name} on activity {!relatedTo.ResourcedActivity__r.KimbleOne__FullName__c}. Awaiting your consent."
    recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__Timesheet__c">
    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >

        <html>

        <body>
        <div id="content"
            style="border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #810541; background-color: #F8F8F8; margin: 10px;">
        <h2
            style="padding: 30px 30px 30px 30px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: #810541; border-bottom-width: 1px; margin: 10px;">
        {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TimeEntry__c.LabelPlural} created for resource {!relatedTo.Resource__r.Name} on activity {!relatedTo.ResourcedActivity__r.KimbleOne__FullName__c}. Awaiting your consent.
        </h2>
        <h3 style="padding: 10px 30px 10px 30px; margin: 10px;">
            Please confirm that the following {!$ObjectType.Timesheet__c.Label} is approved:
        </h3>
        <p style="padding: 10px 30px 10px 30px; margin: 10px;">
        {!$ObjectType.Resource__c.label}: <b>{!relatedTo.Resource__r.Name}</b><br />
        Activity: <b>{!relatedTo.ResourcedActivity__r.FullName__c}</b></p>



            <c:ApprovalEmailTemplateEntries TimesheetId="{!relatedTo.Id}" isPlainText="false" 
                rowStyle="border-width: 1px; padding: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #810541; background-color: #FFFFF0;"
                headStyle="color: #FFFFFF; border-width: 1px; padding: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #810541; background-color: #B0B0B0;"/>
       



        <p style="padding: 10px 30px 10px 30px; margin: 10px;">You can
        approve or reject this Timesheet, by replying to this email and
        entering either <span style="color: #FF0000; font-weight: bold;">APPROVED</span>
        or <span style="color: #FF0000; font-weight: bold;">REJECTED</span> in
        the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you
        have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact our
        Operations Department on 0207-876 5432, or operations@kimbleapps.com.
        <br />
        <br />
        Regards <br />
        {!$Organization.Name} Operations Department<br />
        </p>

        </div>
        </body>
        </html>

    </messaging:htmlEmailBody>
    <messaging:plainTextEmailBody >


{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TimeEntry__c.LabelPlural} created for resource {!relatedTo.Resource__r.Name} on activity {!relatedTo.ResourcedActivity__r.KimbleOne__FullName__c}. Awaiting your consent.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Please confirm that the following {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__Timesheet__c.Label} is approved:
        
{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__Resource__c.label}: {!relatedTo.Resource__r.Name}
{!$Label.kimbleone__activitylabel}: {!relatedTo.ResourcedActivity__r.KimbleOne__FullName__c}
    
 
                
                
 <c:ApprovalEmailTemplateEntries TimesheetId="{!relatedTo.Id}"
            isPlainText="true" />               

You can approve or reject this {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__Timesheet__c.Label}, by replying to this email and entering either APPROVED 
or REJECTED in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries 
regarding this confirmation please contact our Operations Department on 0207-876 5432, or operations@kimbleapps.com. 

Regards {!$Organization.Name} 
Operations Department        

 </messaging:plainTextEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>